1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The doors are locked. 
Through the keyhole, you hear voices.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Still no word from Fulgrim's men?

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
No, sir.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Or Gachette? Or RuPaul?

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
No, sir. She will not be pleased.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
She must earn patience.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
What news, Mage Captain?

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The Bail Norn is locked away, Mistress. 
No one has entered.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
That is well. And the intruders?

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
We have not found them yet, but...

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
but I grew tired of this.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
You command now.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,400
Yes.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Mistress, an idea.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
With your leave, I will unlock the doors.

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
And be ready.

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
If you fail, pray that they kill you.

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Get up, you maggots! Get up, you!

19
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Get everyone in here! Everyone!

20
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,500
Everyone, and you, unlock the doors.
